<title>FRANCE: TABLE-Europe 1 H1 net attrib profit steady.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Europe 1 H1 net attrib profit steady.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable		    56.69  vs	56.60</p>
<p>    Net profit			    51.64  vs	58.34</p>
<p>    Financial loss			18.20  vs gain  0.8</p>
<p>    Current profit before tax	 37.58  vs     109.68</p>
<p>    Exceptional gain		    23.92  vs loss 33.02</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    55.6   vs     109.60</p>
<p>    Turnover			   1,406.6   vs   1,352.9</p>
<p>NOTE - Europe 1 gave the figures in the BALO bulletin. It said it expected to show a net attributable profit &quot;equivalent or slightly higher&quot; in the full year 1996/97 than in 1995/96, when it posted a net attributable profit of 70.5 million francs. -- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
